    {
      "text": "no matter what role uses AI, um this velocity is going to look very different in small teams like one to three people that are building new products",
      "timestamp_sec": 156,
      "why": "Frames the small-team vs. large-org distinction that separates this talk from typical vibe-coding demos."
    },
    {
      "text": "It's an MCP server that gives AI tools access to all of the knowledge and data that we have documented over the years",
      "timestamp_sec": 198,
      "why": "Names the specific institutional-knowledge plumbing that made non-engineer contribution viable."
    },
    {
      "text": "I had never until then actually built and shipped something in code. And I mean at work.",
