      "why": "Establishes the baseline that makes the rest of the story measurable."
    },
    {
      "text": "the solution that I proposed raised questions with the engineer around performance, around maintenance, and if we would be able to to build it in the first place",
      "timestamp_sec": 583,
      "why": "Names the friction point AI let her route around — a real tradeoff, not a success story."
    },
    {
      "text": "the discovery portion was three people, but the design and build was just myself. And it took around 2 and 1/2 weeks to build this.",
      "timestamp_sec": 639,
      "why": "Concrete team size and duration for the flagship project."
    },
    {
      "text": "delivering this this product was a defining moment for me, where I moved from a designer to a design engineer. This is of course enabled by AI, but most of all, it was enabled by the fact that I could own the entire process.",
      "timestamp_sec": 732,
      "why": "Explicitly ranks organizational agency above the tooling as the causal factor."
    },
    {
      "text": "I could just build whatever I thought was um was needed, and I didn't have to spend a lot of time in negotiations and handover",
      "timestamp_sec": 776,
      "why": "Identifies coordination overhead, not implementation speed, as the thing that was removed."
    },
    {
      "text": "In only 6 days, we went from zero to uh through the entire process to building an iOS chat for WooCommerce merchants",
      "timestamp_sec": 776,
      "why": "The compounding-speed data point that closes the arc."
    },
    {
      "text": "we started the exploration as a cloud code project folder where all of the chats and ideas were recorded into a file system. And I I noticed that that um significantly uh sped up collaboration",
      "timestamp_sec": 893,
      "why": "A specific, portable workflow practice she kept after the experiment."
    },
    {
      "text": "that's the biggest shift for our process because normally we would start in Figma and we would work in Figma until we reach very high fidelity",
      "timestamp_sec": 893,
      "why": "The design-process inversion stated plainly."
    },
    {
      "text": "in only 30 days, my process that has been similar for years has completely shifted. And that was true for many other people.",
      "timestamp_sec": 936,
